        "answer": {
          "short": "$245^{\\circ}$",
          "worked": "At B, BC lies $75^{\\circ}$ anticlockwise from BA.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Bearing from B to C}&=320^{\\circ}-75^{\\circ}\\\\&=245^{\\circ}\\end{align*}$$",
